>## Strip type annotations (TypeLambda, TypeApplication, binding type schemes) from terms while preserving lambda domain types and other annotations
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term removeTypeAnnotationsFromTerm = λ`term`.let strip := λrecurse,`term`.let rewritten := recurse `term` in let stripBinding := λb.model.Binding{name = model.Binding[name] b, `term` = model.Binding[`term`] b, typeScheme = none} in cases(model.Term){`let`=λlt.model.Term{`let` = model.Let{bindings = lists.map stripBinding (model.Let[bindings] lt), body = model.Let[body] lt}}, typeApplication=λtt.model.TypeApplicationTerm[body] tt, typeLambda=λta.model.TypeLambda[body] ta, `_`=rewritten} rewritten in rewriting.rewriteTerm strip `term`
