>
>## Strip type annotations from terms while preserving other annotations
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term removeTypesFromTerm = λ`term`.let strip := λrecurse,`term`.let rewritten := recurse `term` in let stripBinding := λb.model.Binding{name = model.Binding[name] b, `term` = model.Binding[`term`] b, typeScheme = none} in cases(model.Term){lambda=λl.model.Term{lambda = model.Lambda{parameter = model.Lambda[parameter] l, domain = none, body = model.Lambda[body] l}}, `let`=λlt.model.Term{`let` = model.Let{bindings = lists.map stripBinding (model.Let[bindings] lt), body = model.Let[body] lt}}, typeApplication=λtt.model.TypeApplicationTerm[body] tt, typeLambda=λta.model.TypeLambda[body] ta, `_`=rewritten} rewritten in rewriting.rewriteTerm strip `term`
